      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُجْمَرٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِجْمَرٌ</span>: ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  and see also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِجْمَرَةٌ</span>, in
two places. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  Also, (S, K,) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُجْمِرٌ</span></b> , (K,) A
<i>hard</i> solid hoof: (AA, S, K:) and a <i>hard,
strong, compact</i> camel's foot: or one <i>that has
been wounded by the stones, and become hard.</i>
(TA.)

